WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.458
If you want to be good, 
do what they say you should,

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:03.625
but if you want to be great,

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:04.750
you innovate.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.583
Whitney Wolfe Herd, 
CEO and founder of Bumble.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:11.791
The youngest woman 
to take a company public.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.625
We need to rewrite the rules.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:16.625
Let's do it.

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:22.291
I will speak
vulnerably about

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:24.000
the difficulties
I'm having somewhere.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.708
To see a leader be vulnerable,

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.416
c
it makes people feel connected.

00:00:31.125 --> 00:00:32.875
Contrary to popular belief,

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:35.541
Bumble started with a
pretty modest budget.

00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:37.666
We had to be really thoughtful

00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:39.166
and really, really creative.

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:42.166
I'm going to show 
you how to do that too.

00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:46.250
Don't hold yourself back
by society's

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.916
perception of who you are.

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:52.208
Why aren't we being the masters
of our own destiny?

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.458
I'm Whitney Wolfe Herd,
and this is MasterClass.

